                                "sense_id": "fd20e8f6-6f60-39cb-a3be-c4b7f266ac38",
                                "text": "Scott... had told me at the Closerie des Lilas how he wrote what he thought were good stories, and which really were good stories for the Post, and then changed them for submission, knowing exactly how he must make the twists that made them into salable magazine stories. I had been shocked at this and I said I thought it was whoring. He said it was whoring but that he had to do it..."
                            },
