                                "example_id": "d30e7448-267c-4362-8036-2098320b5e46",
                                "sense_id": "fd20e8f6-6f60-39cb-a3be-c4b7f266ac38",
                                "text": "Yet she increased her whorings, remembering the days of her youth, when she played the whore in the land of Egypt and lusted after her paramours"
